<title>UK: TABLE - Coats 1996 profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coats 1996 profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.7		    vs 13.4</p>
